# Normalise line endings in the index and check every text file out with LF,
# on Windows too. The test suite runs on windows-latest (issue #121), and a
# CRLF checkout would rewrite fixtures, shell scripts and Go sources under the
# runner's default core.autocrlf=true — changing bytes the tests hash and
# compare.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures must never be touched by the text filters.
*.pdf binary
